WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:06.790
During a live handoff, open quick search and enter the ticket number rather than an ambiguous equipment name.

00:00:06.790 --> 00:00:12.530
Read the matching result before opening it, then compare the workspace header with the number you were given.

00:00:12.530 --> 00:00:16.780
Use Details to verify the studio and owner before discussing the case.
